---
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
import { YEARS } from '../data/site';
---

<div class="story">
  <div class="story-media">
    <Photo
      name="portrait-decks"
      widths={[400, 620, 900]}
      sizes="(max-width: 820px) 90vw, 34vw"
      class="story-img"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="story-copy" data-reveal-group>
    <h2>Three years. Three national titles. <em>One</em> woman had ever done it.</h2>

    <blockquote>
      <p>
        The turntable is the only instrument where the record is the raw material and the hands are
        the composition.
      </p>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        She started competing because nobody in the room looked like her. In 2018 she took third at
        Red Bull 3Style Canada. In 2019 she competed at the Goldie Awards. Then, in 2022, she won
        the DMC Canadian championship — and won it again in 2023, and again in 2024.
      </p>
      <p>
        No woman in the history of the DMC had won three consecutive national titles. In 2023 she
        carried the Canadian title to London and finished top nine at the Technics DMC World Finals.
        She remains the only woman to have competed at all four majors: DMC World, IDA World, the
        Goldie Awards and Red Bull 3Style.
      </p>
      <p>
        That record is why a corporate planner books her instead of a DJ from a directory. The
        titles are the proof. The work is reading a ballroom of eight hundred people and knowing
        exactly when to take the tempo up.
      </p>
      <a class="tlink" href="/about">Read the full story <span class="arw" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>

    <ol class="years" data-reveal-group>
      {
        YEARS.map((y) => (
          <li>
            <b>{y.year}</b>
            <span class="small muted">{y.note}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .story-media :global(.story-img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .story-copy h2 { margin-bottom: 28px; }

  blockquote {
    border-left: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tan) 35%, transparent);
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  blockquote p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2.1vw, 28px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--bone);
    max-width: 22em;
  }

  .story-copy .prose a.tlink { margin-top: 20px; }

  .years {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding-top: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .years li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 84px 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 13px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
  }
  .years b {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--tan);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .story-media { max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
